{"slug":"nick-rahall","qid":"Q262534","name":"Nick Rahall","desc":"American politician","article":"Nick Rahall","born":"1949-05-20","died":null,"birthplace":"Beckley","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"WV-03","f":1993,"u":2015},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"WV-04","f":1977,"u":1993}],"summary":"Nicholas Joseph Rahall II ( RAY-hall; born May 20, 1949) is an American politician and member of the Democratic Party who served in the United States House of Representatives from 1977 to 2015. He is the longest-serving member ever of the United States House of Representatives from the state of West Virginia.\nHe began his political service in the early 1970s working in the cloak room of the U.S. Senate, as a staff member in the Senate Office of the Majority Whip from 1971–1974, and as a delegate to the Democratic National Conventions in 1972 and 1976.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":62688,"s":44.65,"w":false,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":108199,"s":53.98,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":83636,"s":56.04,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":133522,"s":66.92,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":92413,"s":69.36,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":142682,"s":65.2,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":87783,"s":70.22,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":146807,"s":91.31,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":78814,"s":86.6,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":145550,"s":100.0,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall II"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":74967,"s":63.88,"w":true,"n":"Nick J Rahall Jr."},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"WV-03","p":"D","v":122279,"s":65.64,"w":true,"n":"